(   [Problem Statement]: Examine the economic and ecological Values of Biodiversity, differentiating Consumptive, Productive, Social, Ethical, and Option Values.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Comprehensive Valuation Framework of Biological Diversity:) Tj
T*
(   1. Direct Economic Values:) Tj
T*
(   - Consumptive Use Value: Direct non-market consumption of natural resources harvested directly) Tj
T*
(   from ecosystems by local communities:) Tj
T*
(   * Subsistence fuelwood, wild edible berries, bushmeat, wild leafy greens, medicinal plants) Tj
T*
(   gathered by tribal populations. Does NOT enter formal monetary markets.) Tj
T*
(   - Productive Use Value: Commercially harvested biological products assigned market prices and) Tj
T*
(   traded in national and international commerce:) Tj
T*
(   * Timber \(Teak, Rosewood\), pulpwood, pharmaceutical natural compounds \(e.g., Paclitaxel from) Tj
T*
(   Taxus wallichiana, Vincristine from Catharanthus roseus\), natural rubber, silk, commercial) Tj
T*
(   marine fisheries.) Tj
T*
(   2. Indirect Ecological Values \(Non-Consumptive\):) Tj
T*
(   - Ecosystem Services: Watershed hydrological purification, groundwater recharge, atmospheric) Tj
T*
(   carbon sequestration, microclimate stabilization, insect pollination \(responsible for ~35% of) Tj
T*
(   global food crop production\), and soil fertility maintenance through nutrient cycling.) Tj
T*
(   3. Social and Ethical Values:) Tj
T*
(   - Social Value: Cultural and religious integration of biodiversity into human traditions.) Tj
T*
(   Exemplified in India by the veneration of sacred plants \(Tulsi - Ocimum sanctum, Peepal - Ficus) Tj
T*
(   religiosa\) and sacred animal totems, reinforcing conservation taboos.) Tj
T*
(   - Ethical \(Intrinsic\) Value: The philosophical principle of Biocentrism: Every living species) Tj
T*
(   possesses an inherent right to exist independent of its economic utility to human beings.) Tj
T*
(   4. Aesthetic and Option Values:) Tj
T*
(   - Aesthetic Value: Ecotourism, wildlife safari photography, wilderness hiking, providing) Tj
T*
(   psychological restoration and major revenue.) Tj
T*
(   - Option Value: The potential economic or pharmaceutical value that a biological species may) Tj
T*
(   yield in the future \(e.g., an unstudied rainforest fungus producing a novel antibiotic to) Tj
T*
(   combat multi-drug resistant pathogens\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
