(   - Critically Endangered: Great Indian Bustard \(Ardeotis nigriceps\), Gharial \(Gavialis) Tj
T*
(   gangeticus\), White-backed Vulture \(Gyps bengalensis, poisoned by veterinary diclofenac\), Pygmy) Tj
T*
(   Hog \(Porcula salvania\).) Tj
T*
(   - Endangered: Bengal Tiger, Asian Elephant, Snow Leopard, Lion-tailed Macaque, Gangetic River) Tj
T*
(   Dolphin \(Platanista gangetica\).) Tj
T*
