(   1. Statutory Mandate and Objectives:) Tj
T*
(   Enacted in 2002 to implement India's sovereign obligations under the 1992 UN Convention on) Tj
T*
(   Biological Diversity \(CBD\). The Act has three foundational pillars:) Tj
T*
(   - Conservation of biological diversity.) Tj
T*
(   - Sustainable use of its biological components.) Tj
T*
(   - Fair and equitable sharing of benefits arising out of the utilization of biological resources) Tj
T*
(   and associated traditional knowledge.) Tj
T*
(   2. Three-Tier Institutional Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - National Biodiversity Authority \(NBA\): Established at Chennai. Regulates requests for) Tj
T*
(   commercial utilization of Indian bioresources or associated traditional knowledge by foreign) Tj
T*
(   individuals or corporate entities. Approves intellectual property rights \(patents\) based on) Tj
T*
(   Indian biological material.) Tj
T*
(   - State Biodiversity Boards \(SBBs\): Established in every state. Regulates commercial) Tj
T*
(   utilization of bioresources by Indian commercial enterprises.) Tj
T*
(   - Biodiversity Management Committees \(BMCs\): Constituted by local self-government bodies \(Gram) Tj
T*
(   Panchayats, Municipalities\) in every village and town. Responsible for local conservation,) Tj
T*
(   documenting traditional knowledge, and preparing People's Biodiversity Registers \(PBRs\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Access and Benefit Sharing \(ABS\) Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   - Commercial bioprospecting corporations must obtain prior approval from the NBA/SBB.) Tj
T*
(   - The commercial entity must enter into an ABS agreement committing to share financial) Tj
T*
(   royalties \(typically 0.1% to 0.5% of ex-factory gross sales of products developed from Indian) Tj
T*
(   biological materials\).) Tj
T*
(   - Royalties collected are deposited into the National/State Biodiversity Fund, with at least) Tj
T*
(   95% channeled directly back to local BMCs and tribal communities who nurtured the germplasm and) Tj
T*
(   traditional knowledge.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
