(   - Proportions: p_A = 0.40, p_B = 0.30, p_C = 0.20, p_D = 0.10.) Tj
T*
(   - Natural logs: ln\(0.4\) = -0.9163; ln\(0.3\) = -1.2040; ln\(0.2\) = -1.6094; ln\(0.1\) = -2.3026.) Tj
T*
(   - Products [p_i * ln\(p_i\)]:) Tj
T*
(   * A: 0.40 * \(-0.9163\) = -0.3665) Tj
T*
(   * B: 0.30 * \(-1.2040\) = -0.3612) Tj
T*
(   * C: 0.20 * \(-1.6094\) = -0.3219) Tj
T*
(   * D: 0.10 * \(-2.3026\) = -0.2303) Tj
T*
(   - Sum = -1.2799 => H' = -\(-1.2799\) = 1.28.) Tj
T*
(   - Evenness: H'_max = ln\(4\) = 1.3863 => J' = 1.28 / 1.3863 = 0.923 \(92.3% of maximum possible) Tj
T*
(   diversity\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
