T*
(   3. The Advance Informed Agreement \(AIA\) Procedure:) Tj
T*
(   Applies to the first intentional transboundary transshipment of an LMO intended for) Tj
T*
(   environmental release \(e.g., transgenic crop seeds like Bt cotton or GM canola\):) Tj
T*
(   - Notification: The exporting state must notify the National Competent Authority of the) Tj
T*
(   importing state in writing with a comprehensive dossier detailing genetic construct, taxonomic) Tj
T*
(   traits, and phenotypic modifications.) Tj
T*
(   - Risk Assessment: The importing state conducts an environmental risk assessment evaluating) Tj
T*
(   horizontal gene transfer, potential weediness, and toxicity to non-target organisms.) Tj
T*
(   - Decision Window: The importing state has 270 days to make an evidence-based sovereign) Tj
T*
(   decision: approve unconditionally, approve with risk mitigation conditions, or prohibit import.) Tj
T*
(   4. Biosafety Clearing-House \(BCH\):) Tj
T*
(   A centralized online information portal facilitating the global exchange of scientific,) Tj
T*
(   technical, and regulatory biosafety data on LMOs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
