(   - Step 4 \(Dehydration with Vitrification Solution PVS2\):) Tj
T*
(   Treating tissues at 0 deg C with Plant Vitrification Solution 2 \(PVS2: 30% glycerol, 15%) Tj
T*
(   ethylene glycol, 15% DMSO, and 0.4 M sucrose\). PVS2 rapidly dehydrates cells, elevating) Tj
T*
